  "ruleText": "Den 101.27 “President” means president of the board chosen pursuant to RSA 317-A:4.\n\nSource. #287.2 eff 1-17-74; ss by #2981, eff 2-28-85; ss by #4262-a, eff 5-19-87; ss by #5110, eff 4-4-91; amd by #5722, eff 10-15-93; ss by #6908, eff 12-9-98; renumbered by #12427 (formerly 101.19); renumbered by #14140 (formerly Den 101.23)",
